            <ArticleTitle>Overcoming the challenges of neuropathic pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>47-53; quiz 54-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Neuropathic pain can originate from a variety of conditions. Early treatment is vital. Nurses have an important role in initiating treatment and providing ongoing pain management and support for patients.</AbstractText>
